<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Authors | Rosa Aguilar</title><link>/authors/</link><atom:link href="/authors/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>Authors</description><generator>Source Themes Academic (https://sourcethemes.com/academic/)</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>/img/icon-192.png</url><title>Authors</title><link>/authors/</link></image><item><title/><link>/authors/admin/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/admin/</guid><description>&lt;p>I am an &lt;strong>Assistant Professor in Machine Learning and Data Integration&lt;/strong> at the Faculty ITC, University of Twente. I build machine learning and computer vision pipelines for satellite imagery and spatiotemporal data, from detecting crops, open spaces, solar panels from space to benchmarking AI agents in QGIS.
My teaching topics include scientific programming, machine learning, data science, ethics in relation to spatial data and GeoAI in the UNIGIS MSc - University of Twente and Vrije Universitait.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>As a &lt;strong>QGIS contributor and open-source advocate&lt;/strong> I maintain the &lt;a href="project/ml4qgis/">ML4QGIS&lt;/a> plugin. I have also contributed to the organization of FOSS4G/QGIS conferences and deliver talks and workshops. Before academia I was Deputy President of the Geographic Institute of Venezuela.
I &lt;a href="#partner">welcome collaboration&lt;/a> with industry and government.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Frank Ostermann</title><link>/authors/frank-ostermann/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/frank-ostermann/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Pitchaporn Likitpanjamanon</title><link>/authors/pitchaporn-likitpanjamanon/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/pitchaporn-likitpanjamanon/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Daniel Bowman Simon</title><link>/authors/daniel-bowman-simon/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/daniel-bowman-simon/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Johannes Flacke</title><link>/authors/johannes-flacke/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/johannes-flacke/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Karin Pfeffer</title><link>/authors/karin-pfeffer/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/karin-pfeffer/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Ana Oliveira</title><link>/authors/ana-oliveira/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/ana-oliveira/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Andrew C. W. Leung</title><link>/authors/andrew-c.-w.-leung/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/andrew-c.-w.-leung/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Britta Jänicke</title><link>/authors/britta-janicke/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/britta-janicke/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Dragan D. Milošević</title><link>/authors/dragan-d.-milosevic/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/dragan-d.-milosevic/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gustavo Adolfo García-Chapeton</title><link>/authors/gustavo-adolfo-garcia-chapeton/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/authors/gustavo-adolfo-garcia-chap